```
{{/if}}

{{#if (ne elixirCli "none")}}
## Command line

`mix {{elixirAppName}}.greet` runs `{{elixirModuleName}}.CLI`, which parses its arguments with
{{#if (eq elixirCli "optimus")}}
Optimus (typed options, validation errors, and `--help`).
{{else if (eq elixirCli "owl")}}
`OptionParser` and prints the result in an Owl box.
{{else if (eq elixirCli "option-parser")}}
the built-in `OptionParser`.
{{/if}}

```sh
mix {{elixirAppName}}.greet --name Ada --times 2
```

Invalid options print an error and exit with status 1.
{{/if}}

